{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>P.O.N.</strong>\u00a0\u2014 is a 1\u20134 player co-op horror-heist. Plant bombs, steal intel, kidnap VIPs\u2014and get out alive. A mysterious entity hunts those who make noise or slip up. Teamwork is your only hope; one wrong move, and the whole operation falls apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u00ab</i></strong>\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc2d... \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc22\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc1c\ud835\udc24.<strong><i>\u00bb</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One moment you\u2019re running with the score. The next, the shadows claim your fastest man. In this heist, stealth isn\u2019t just smart\u2014it\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864580/extras/939ae2629a92239d9dd2f47eefe22d4b.poster.avif?t=1752664825\" aria-label=\"&amp;quot;\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc2d... \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc22\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc1c\ud835\udc24.&amp;quot; One moment you\u2019re running with the score. The next, the shadows claim your fastest man. In this heist, stealth isn\u2019t just smart\u2014it\u2019s survival.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864580/extras/939ae2629a92239d9dd2f47eefe22d4b.webm?t=1752664825\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864580/extras/939ae2629a92239d9dd2f47eefe22d4b.mp4?t=1752664825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></